    {
      "subId": "4007210",
      "subQuestName": "Find the source of the voice",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "400721001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "400721001": {
            "id": "400721001",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Leon",
            "text": "Oh, thank goodness... Huh? What are you guys doing here!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400721002"
            ]
          },
          "400721002": {
            "id": "400721002",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "We should be the ones asking that. What are you doing here?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4007214",
      "subQuestName": "Save Leon",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4007218",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Leon",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "400721801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "400721801": {
            "id": "400721801",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Leon",
            "text": "I'm sorry you have to keep seeing me in such a wretched state. I suppose I'm still not good enough to play the role of a qualified Nachtraben Ritter...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400721802"
            ]
          },
          "400721802": {
            "id": "400721802",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
            "text": "\"Play the role\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400721803"
            ]
          },
          "400721803": {
            "id": "400721803",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Leon",
            "text": "I'm ashamed to admit it, but I'm not a real knight... rather, I'm a new actor who recently landed a job to play the role of a knight in a theater troupe!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400721804"
            ]
          },
          "400721804": {
            "id": "400721804",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's not really something to be smug about.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400721805"
            ]
          },
          "400721805": {
            "id": "400721805",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Leon",
            "text": "Ah, well, you see, that's where you're mistaken! Theater is an essential part of Immernachtreich's culture. A fantastic theatrical performance is the greatest tribute we can pay to Her Highness.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400721806"
            ]
          },
          "400721806": {
            "id": "400721806",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Oh, so this is your local culture?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400721807"
            ]
          },
          "400721807": {
            "id": "400721807",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Leon",
            "text": "Exactly! So I'm delighted that I got to play the knight!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400721808"
            ]
          },
          "400721808": {
            "id": "400721808",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Why does the Prinzessin enjoy the theater so much?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400721809"
            ]
          },
          "400721809": {
            "id": "400721809",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Leon",
            "text": "Her Highness once said, \"Celebrate me by staging a play in the wilderness. Bow down to me, and bring me beautiful dreams in return for everlasting glory within the eternal darkness.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400721810"
            ]
          },
          "400721810": {
            "id": "400721810",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Leon",
            "text": "I believe it is because Her Highness appreciates true art, and can also sense emotions hidden deep within the souls of humankind.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400721811"
            ]
          },
          "400721811": {
            "id": "400721811",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Leon",
            "text": "The crystallization and sublime expression of emotion is the heart of theater. People who truly understand theater always have a beautiful, sensitive heart, filled with a rich array of emotion.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400721812"
            ]
          },
          "400721812": {
            "id": "400721812",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "...So that's how it is.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400721813"
            ]
          },
          "400721813": {
            "id": "400721813",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
            "text": "Thank you for your answer, Sir Knight.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400721814"
            ]
          },
          "400721814": {
            "id": "400721814",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Leon",
            "text": "O—Oh! Th—Thank you so much for calling me a knight!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400721815"
            ]
          },
          "400721815": {
            "id": "400721815",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Leon",
            "text": "So, basking still in this honor, I will be off to my battleground. May we meet again!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400721816"
            ]
          },
          "400721816": {
            "id": "400721816",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hopefully not... Be more careful in the future!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400721817"
            ]
          },
          "400721817": {
            "id": "400721817",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Leon",
            "text": "Oh, and please remember the password to unlock the gate, \"Upon my command, spread your wings and take flight.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
